{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-engineering","title":"隐私工程","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/differential-privacy","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"anonymization-deidentification","title":"数据匿名化与脱敏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/anonymization-deidentification","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/differential-privacy","wordCount":1222,"readingTime":5},{"seq":4,"slug":"privacy-by-design","title":"隐私设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/privacy-by-design","wordCount":1114,"readingTime":5},{"seq":5,"slug":"anonymization-techniques","title":"数据匿名化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/anonymization-techniques","wordCount":1248,"readingTime":5},{"seq":6,"slug":"federated-learning","title":"联邦学习与隐私计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/federated-learning","wordCount":1552,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"隐私工程-简介\">隐私工程 简介</h1><p>本章聚焦隐私保护的技术实现方法。隐私保护不仅是法律合规的要求，更需要通过工程技术手段来落地。隐私工程将隐私原则转化为可实施的技术方案，是连接法规要求和系统实现的桥梁。</p>\n<p><strong>隐私设计</strong>介绍隐私保护的设计理念和方法论，包括Privacy by Design的七项原则、隐私影响评估和数据保护架构设计。</p>\n<p><strong>匿名化技术</strong>讲解数据匿名化和去标识化的核心技术，涵盖k-匿名性、l-多样性、t-紧密性以及各技术的适用场景和局限性。</p>\n<p><strong>差分隐私</strong>探讨差分隐私的数学原理和工程实践，包括隐私预算管理、噪声添加机制和差分隐私在机器学习中的应用。</p>\n<p>建议读者在理解隐私法规要求的基础上学习本章，将法规合规转化为具体的技术实现方案。</p>\n"}